# Committed on purpose, as an exception to the line above. It holds one
# localhost URL and nothing secret, and without it a fresh clone's
# `npm run dev:landing` has an "Explore Bambai" button that 404s — the map
# runs on a different port in development. Never put a secret in here.
!.env.development
